<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt sets warrants on German firms.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt sets warrants on German firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt said it had issued 195 million American-style call and put warrants, in 39 equal tranches, on various German firms.</p>
<p>There are tranches set on BASF AG, Bayer AG, Daimler-Benz AG, Deutsche Bank AG, Deutsche Lufthansa AG, Hoechst AG, Mannesmann AG, RWE AG, Thyssen AG, VEBA AG and Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	 DUSS, FRFT, HAMG, STUTTGART</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
